{{swp|vi:}}

===Etymology===
{{vi-etym-sino|魔}}.

The modern Vietnamese usage of {{m|vi||ma|ghost}} and {{m|vi|quỷ||demon; ogre}} is contrary to that of {{cog|cmn|魔||demon}} and {{m|cmn|鬼||ghost}}. This can be exemplified in the pair {{m|vi|'''ma''' đói}} vs. {{m|zh|餓'''鬼'''|tr=ngạ '''quỷ'''||preta}}.

