mà.raw:
===Etymology===
Within Austroasiatic, compare {{cog|pac|ma||but, topicalizer}} and {{cog|omx|ma||relative marker}}.

===Pronunciation===
{{vi-IPA}}
* {{audio|vi|LL-Q9199 (vie)-Jessica Nguyen (Pamputt)-mà.wav|a=Ho Chi Minh City}}

===Conjunction===
{{vi-conj|[[𦓡]], [[麻]]}}

# [[but]]; [[however]]; [[nevertheless]]
#: {{syn|vi|nhưng|nhưng mà}}
#: {{uxi|vi|già '''mà''' vẫn khoẻ|old '''but''' still energetic}}
#: {{ux|vi|Mới đi có chút '''mà''' thằng ất ơ nào chiếm chỗ rồi.|I was just gone for a bit '''but''' some random dude already took my place.}}
#: {{ux|vi|Nhìn trong hộp rồi '''mà''' hông thấy.|I already looked into the box '''but''' I can't see it.}}
#* {{RQ:Nguyen Ngoc Tu CDBT|chapter=Mối tình năm cũ|passage=Trần Hưng rất hài lòng với những đoạn phim vừa thu được, nó nổi bật lên phần đời của người chiến sĩ này, giản dị '''mà''' cao quý, bình thường '''mà''' phi thường.|translation=Trần Hưng was very satisfied with the footage just shot; it highlighted the life of this fighter, simple '''but''' lofty, ordinary '''but''' extraordinary.}}
# [[which]], [[whom]], [[that]], [[where]]
#: {{ux|vi|Bài kiểm tra '''mà''' tuần trước mình làm.|The exam '''that''' we took last week.}}
# {{lb|vi|preceding a verb with neutral or negative connotation}} [[and]]; [[and]] [[then]]; [[and]] [[so]] {{q|marks succession of actions or causality}}
#: {{uxi|vi|đến '''mà''' xem|to come '''and''' see}}
#: {{uxi|vi|nghe cho kĩ '''mà''' làm|to listen closely '''in order to''' do it well}}
#: {{uxi|vi|thắt cổ '''mà''' chết|to hang oneself '''and''' die}}
#: {{uxi|vi|đói '''mà''' chết|to starve '''to''' death}}

====See also====
{{col|vi|cơ mà|nhưng mà}}

===Particle===
{{vi-particle}}

# {{lb|vi|colloquial}} {{n-g|Final affirmative particle, indicating emphasis or contrast.}}
#: {{ux|vi|Tôi có làm gì đâu '''mà'''!|I '''really''' didn't do anything!}}
#: {{ux|vi|Ngon '''mà''', sao chê dữ vậy?|It tastes pretty good '''tho/actually''', not sure why you gotta shit on it that much.}}
# {{lb|vi|colloquial}} {{n-g|An intensifier, placed before an adjective or verb}}
#: {{uxi|vi|thấy '''mà''' ghê|disgusted '''just''' (by) looking (at it)}}
#: {{uxi|vi|nghĩ '''mà''' sướng|elated '''just''' thinking (about it)}}

====See also====
{{col|vi|mà thôi}}

má.raw:
===Pronunciation===
{{vi-IPA}}
* {{audio|vi|LL-Q9199 (vie)-Jessica Nguyen (Pamputt)-má.wav|a=Ho Chi Minh City}}

===Etymology 1===
{{picdic/vi/Gesicht}}
From {{inh|vi|mkh-vie-pro|*-maːʔ}}, from {{inh|vi|mkh-pro|-}}. Cognate with {{cog|tou|-}} [Cuối Chăm] ''maː³'' ("cheek"), {{cog|aem|-}} ''umæːʔ'' ("gills"), {{cog|mkh-pal-pro|*cəmaːʔ||cheek}} (whence {{cog|ril|-}} [Sak] ''sᵊmɑʔ²''), {{cog|aav-nic-pro|*samaː}} (whence {{cog|ncb|-}} [Nancowry] {{m|cbs|shama||jaw}}) and {{cog|bfw|-}} ''ǰama'' ("jaw").

This item might be an infixed form (nominalizing {{m|aav-pro|*-m-}}) of the root {{m|aav-pro|*ca(ː)ʔ||to eat}}, as suggested in Sidwell (2018).

====Noun====
{{vi-noun|cls=cái|[[𦟐]]}}

# {{lb|vi|anatomy}} [[cheek]]

=====Derived terms=====
{{col3|vi|mông má|má hồng|má đào|bạc má|má phấn môi son}}

===Etymology 2===
{{vi-etym-sino|媽|hv=n|[[mother]]|ma}}, ultimately a nursery word. ''Đại Nam quấc âm tự vị'' (1895) directly annotates this as ''kêu theo tiếng {{l|vi|khách|Khách}}'' ("way of calling from Chinese") and it was also often paired with {{m|vi|tía}} (another Chinese loan) to form {{m|vi|tía má}}.

====Alternative forms====
* {{alt|vi|q=minced oath|moá}}

====Noun====
{{vi-noun|[[媽]], [[𦟐]]}}

# {{lb|vi|Southern Vietnam}} [[mother]]; [[mom]]
#: {{syn|vi|mạ|mẹ|mợ|u|bầm|đẻ}}

=====Derived terms=====
{{col3|vi|ba má|tía má}}

===Etymology 3===
From {{inh|vi|mkh-vie-pro|*s-maːʔ}}, whence also {{m|vi|mạ||rice seedlings}}, the form used in isolation.

Not related to the second element in {{m|vi|rau má}}.

====Noun====
{{vi-noun|𥡗}}

# {{lb|vi|only in compounds}} [[rice]] [[seedling]]s

=====Derived terms=====
{{col3|vi|thuế má|giống má|lúa má|giấy má|số má}}

===Etymology 4===

====Noun====
{{vi-noun}}

# {{def-see|vi|rau má|t=Asiatic pennywort}}

===Anagrams===
* {{l|vi|ám}}

{{C|vi|Face|Female|Parents}}

