=====Usage notes=====
{{m|vi|mã|Mã}} is often translated as "[[horse]]" when using {{m|vi|ma}}/{{m|vi|mà}}/{{m|vi|mả}}/{{m|vi|mã}}/{{m|vi|má}}/{{m|vi|mạ}} as an example of tone distinctions in Vietnamese. However, like most Sino-Vietnamese readings, {{m|vi|mã}} can only be used this way as part of certain compound words borrowed from Chinese. The word for "[[horse]]" in Vietnamese is {{m|vi|ngựa}}.

