# [[fine]] [[silk]]
#* {{RQ:Nguyen Trai Quoc am thi tap|chapter=Ngôn chí 言志 3
|passage={{vi-ruby|𩛷咹油固𦼞㙁<br/>襖默奈之錦羅|Bữa ăn dù có dưa muối Áo mặc nài chi gấm '''là'''.}}
|translation=[I don't mind] Even if my meals only have pickles [on the side],<br/> [and] I have no reason to demand good silk for clothing.}}

=====Derived terms=====
{{col|vi
|lụa là
}}

===Etymology 2===
From {{inh|vi|mkh-vie-pro|*laː||to [[work]]}}. {{doublet|vi|làm}}.

====Verb====
{{vi-verb|[[羅]], [[𱺵]], [[𪜀]], [[𦉼]], [[囉]]}}

# {{lb|vi|copula}} to [[be]]
#* {{quote-book|vi|year=1946|origyear=1938|author=Tố Hữu|title=Từ ấy|trans-title=Since Then|chapter=Từ ấy|trans-chapter=Since Then|text=Tôi đã '''là''' con của [[vạn]] nhà<br>'''Là''' em của vạn kiếp phôi pha<br>'''Là''' anh của vạn đầu em nhỏ<br>Không áo cơm, cù bất cù bơ…|t=I '''have been''' the son of all families<br>'''Have been''' the little brother of all fading lives<br>'''Have been''' the big brother of all the young ones<br>Who were starving, shivering and wandering…}}

=====Usage notes=====
* As a [[copula]] verb that is somewhat {{w|semantics|semantically empty}}. It is not perfectly equivalent to copulae in other languages (such as {{cog|en|be}}, {{cog|fr|être}}, {{cog|ja|です|tr=desu}}, {{cog|hi|है}}), as it only links the subject to a noun or noun phrase. Teachers of foreign languages typically translate copulae of those languages to ''là'', but also to {{m|vi|thì}} (for linking to adjectives) to compensate this incompatibility.

{{box-top|Grammar}}
* The copula ''là'' is used in the sentence to link the subject to a [[predicate noun]]. Because nominal predicates strongly prefer the presence of the particle ''là'', it can be characterized as an "identificational/equational marker".
*: {{uxi|vi|Hải '''là''' [[kĩ sư]].|Hải is an engineer.}}
* It is often omitted when occuring with predicate adjectives.
*: {{uxi|vi|Tôi ø [[đói]].|I am hungry.}}
*''Là'' is used with adjectives only to emphasize, confirm, or assert the meaning of the sentence in context. In this case, it can be omitted.
*: {{uxi|vi|[[thói quen|Thói quen]] đó ('''là''') tốt.|That habit is good.}}
*: {{uxi|vi|Gà rán rất ('''là''') ngon.|The fried chicken is really yummy.}}
*: {{uxi|vi|Bộ phim ấy ('''là''') do tôi làm.|That movie was produced by me.}}
*: {{uxi|vi|Đồng chí biết [rằng] điều này ('''là''') sai nhưng không sửa.|Comrade, you know [that] this is wrong but do nothing to fix it.}}
* However, ''là'' is mandatory to make clear the speaker's or writer's intention to utter not just a {{w|noun phrase}} but either a complete {{w|Sentence (linguistics)|sentence}}, or an independent {{w|clause}}, or a dependent clause with dropped subjects.
*: {{uxi|vi|Lao động '''là''' vinh quang.|Labour is glorious.}} 
*: vs. {{uxi|vi|Lao động vinh quang.|Glorious labour.}}
*: {{uxi|vi|Chân lý '''là''' cụ thể, cách mạng '''là''' sáng tạo.|Truth is concrete, revolution is creative.}} 
*: vs. {{uxi|vi|Chân lý cụ thể, cách mạng sáng tạo.|Concrete truth, creative revolution.}}
*: {{uxi|vi|Đồng chí biết [rằng] [điều này] '''là''' đúng nhưng không làm.|Comrade, you know [that] [this] is right but have not done it.}}
*: vs. {{uxi|vi|Đồng chí biết [điều] đúng nhưng không làm.|Comrade, you know the right [thing] but have not done it.}}
* ''Là'' is also used with possessions to indicate that something belongs to someone. The copula can be omitted.
*: {{uxi|vi|Quyển [[sách]] này ('''là''') của tôi.|This book is mine.}}
* In many cases, when a sentence starts with a time phrase, ''là'' simply states the fact of identification of time. The copula can be omitted.
*: {{uxi|vi|[[bây giờ|Bây giờ]] ('''là''') hai giờ rồi.|It's two o'clock already.}}
*: {{uxi|vi|[[ngày mai|Ngày mai]] ('''là''') thứ năm.|Tomorrow is Thursday.}}
* ''Là'' may be used as the predicate to indicate [[existence]], which is equivalent to "there is" or "there are". The word order is: place + '''là''' (+ classifier) + noun. In this case, it cannot be omitted.
*: {{uxi|vi|[[giữa|Giữa]] [[hồ]] '''là''' (một) [[hòn]] [[đảo]].|There is an island in the middle of the lake.}}
{{box-bottom}}

=====See also=====
* {{l|vi|bị}}
* {{l|vi|được}}
* {{l|vi|ở}}

====Conjunction====
{{vi-conj}}

# {{ng|Used to indicate something is bound to happen whenever an event occurs}}
#: {{uxi|vi|Cứ vào mùa hè '''là''' có mưa.|Whenever it's summer, it rains.|lit= When it's in summer is [when] [there] exists rain.}}
#* {{quote-web|vi|work= w:Facebook|author= Thảo Nguyễn|date= 10 March 2025|format= post|url= https://www.facebook.com/100002287495184/posts/9354254857994004/
|text= Năm nào cũng vậy lúc vào mùa thu hoạch '''là''' lúc hạt điều ngon nhất thì lại ế chỏng ế chơ.
|translation= It's the same every year; harvest time is when cashew nuts are most delicious yet unsellable.
|lit= It's the same every year; when it's in harvest time is when cashew nuts are most delicious yet unsellable.}}

====Particle====
{{vi-particle}}

# {{ng|Used to form a reduplicative phrase for emphasizing effect.}}
#: {{uxi|vi|toàn thấy người '''là''' người|to see nothing but people.}}

====Derived terms====
