có.raw:
===Pronunciation===
{{vi-IPA}}
* {{audio|vi|Vi-hanoi-m-có.ogg|a=Hanoi}}
* {{audio|vi|LL-Q9199 (vie)-Jessica Nguyen (Pamputt)-có.wav|a=Ho Chi Minh City}}

===Etymology 1===
[[File:DuongTuHaMau.jpg|alt=阿綿德主[⿰有固]靈庒羅 (Amen! Đức Chúa có linh chăng là.)|thumb|540x540px|"có" written as "[⿰有固]" in Dương Từ - Hà Mậu (楊慈 - 何茂).]]
From {{inh|vi|mkh-vie-pro|*kɔːʔ||to [[have]]}}. Cognate with {{cog|mtq|cỏ}}.

====Verb====
{{vi-verb|[[固]], [[古]], [[故]], [[𣎏]], [[⿰有固]]}}

# to [[have]], to [[possess]]
#: {{syn|vi|sở hữu}}
#: {{ux|vi|Tao '''có''' hai con xe.|I '''have''' two motorbikes. / I '''have''' two cars.}}
#: {{ux|vi|Tôi '''có''' chồng rồi.|I've already '''had''' a husband. / I'm a married woman. / I'm married.}}
#: {{ux|vi|Cậu '''có''' bút chì không? Cho tớ mượn.|Do you '''have''' a pencil? May I borrow it?}}
# there be
#: {{ux|vi|Nhà tôi '''có''' hai con.|'''There are''' two kids in my family.}}
#: {{ux|vi|'''Có''' hai người trong phòng.|'''There are''' two people in that room.}}
#: {{ux|vi|'''Có''' việc gì không ?|Is there a problem? / Is there anything I can help you with? / What is it? / Do you have some business here?}}

=====Usage notes=====
* When functioning as a [[full verb]], ''có'' indicates possession in its broadest sense. ''Có'' can also indicate existence, which is equivalent to "there is" or "there are". In many expressions, ''có'' is simply equivalent to "to have": ''có'' {{m|vi|kinh nghiệm}} ("to have experience"), ''có hai con'' ("to have two children"), ''có'' {{m|vi|bạn gái}} / {{m|vi|bạn trai}} ("to have a girlfriend / boyfriend"), etc. ''Có'' is also used to form [[idiomatic]] expressions; most idiomatic expressions of the "''có'' + noun" type are equivalent to English "to be + adjective": ''có'' {{m|vi|hiếu}} ("to be filial"), ''có'' {{m|vi|tuổi}} ("to be old"), etc. A number of words that contain ''có'' are perceived by native speakers as whole words. ''Có'' has been somewhat bleached of its original meaning in such words as {{m|vi|có khi||maybe, probably}}, {{m|vi|có mặt||to be present}}, {{m|vi|có thể||can, to be able}}, etc.

=====Derived terms=====
{{col|vi|có điều|có thể|có mặt|có khi|có lúc|không có gì|có lẽ|giàu có|gồm có}}

====Noun====
{{vi-noun}}

# the left side of the balance sheet records the existing capital (fixed capital, working capital, etc.)
#: {{ant|vi|nợ}}

====Adjective====
{{vi-adj}}

# {{lb|vi|colloquial}} relatively [[rich]]

====Adverb====
{{vi-adv|[[固]], [[古]], [[故]], [[𣎏]]}}

# {{lb|vi|before verbs|for emphasis or intensification}} [[do]], [[does]], [[did]]
#: {{ux|vi|Mày không biết phải không?<br>Tao '''có''' biết!|You don't know, do you?<br>I '''do''' know, okay?}}
#: {{ux|vi|Em bị mất vở! Em '''có''' làm bài thầy ơi!|I lost my workbook! '''I swear''' I did the assignment!}}
# {{lb|vi|before verbs|in questions (generally ending in {{m|vi|không}})|not before ''có'' itself}} [[do]]
#: {{ux|vi|Bạn '''có''' biết chúng ta chỉ sử dụng 10% não bộ?<br>Có, và đó là chuyện nhảm nhí.|Did you know we only use 10% of our brain?<br>Yes, and that's utter nonsense.}}
#: {{ux|vi|Anh '''có''' định đi chơi đâu '''không'''?|Are you going out?}}
# {{lb|vi|in questions}} [[truly]]
#: {{uxi|vi|'''Có''' thật không?|Is that '''truly''' so?}}
# {{lb|vi|colloquial}} [[just]], [[only]]
#: {{syn|vi|chỉ}}
#: {{ux|vi|Mua '''có''' hai cuốn sách thôi mà có gì ghê?|Buying just two books, what's so great?}}
#: {{ux|vi|Chạy '''có''' xíu mà than với chả thở.|Run just a little bit but already nagging.}}

=====Usage notes=====
* Unlike {{m|vi|chỉ}}, ''có'' in the sense of "only" is placed after the verb.
* Together with the negative particle {{m|vi|không}}, it forms the ''có'' … ''không'' construction which is used to form yes-no questions. See [[không#Usage notes]] for more details.
* Together with the adjective {{m|vi|phải||true, correct}} and the negative particle ''không'', it froms the ''có phải'' … ''không'' construction which is used to form yes-no questions with an expectation for affirmative answers. See [[không#Usage notes]] for more details.

====Interjection====
{{vi-interjection|[[固]], [[古]], [[故]], [[𣎏]]}}

# [[yes]]; yes, [[I do]]
#: {{ux|vi|Bạn có biết chúng ta chỉ sử dụng 10% não bộ?<br>'''Có''', và đó là chuyện nhảm nhí.|Did you know we only use 10% of our brain?<br>'''Yes''', and that's utter nonsense.}}
#: {{ux|vi|Các bạn có muốn được nghỉ sớm không?<br>'''Có'''!|Do you want to go home early?<br>'''Heck yeah'''!}}
# {{lb|vi|in response to a roll call}} {{l|en|[[here]]; [[I'm]] [[here]]; [[present]]}}

====See also====
