sao.raw:
===Pronunciation===
{{vi-IPA}}
* {{audio|vi|LL-Q9199 (vie)-Jessica Nguyen (Pamputt)-sao.wav|a=Ho Chi Minh City}}

===Etymology 1===
Attested as {{m|mkh-mvi|ſao}} in the ''Dictionarium Annamiticum Lusitanum et Latinum'' (1651).

Attested in ''Phật thuyết đại báo phụ mẫu ân trọng kinh'' (佛說大報父母恩重經) as {{ltc-l|牢}} (modern [[Sino-Vietnamese|SV]]: {{m|vi|lao}}), so the older form of the word was ''*C-raːw'' (where ''*C'' is nonspecific consonant). Even after the sound change {{IPAfont|*C-r- > /ʂ/}} had taken place sometime before 17th century, the use of the phonogram {{ltc-l|牢}} continued, so this morpheme was still commonly spelled such in Nôm texts in the 19th-early 20th century.

Most likely a part of the ''r''-series of demonstratives alongside {{m|vi|rày}}, {{m|vi|ri}}, {{m|vi|rứa}} and {{m|vi|ru}}.

====Adverb====
{{vi-adv|[[牢]], [[哰]], [[𣋀]], [[𫳵]]}}

# [[why]]
#: {{syn|vi|răng|tại sao|vì sao}}
#: {{ux|vi|'''Sao''' nó bảo không đến?|'''Why''' did he say he wouldn’t come?}}
#* '''19th century''', {{w|Nguyễn Đình Chiểu}}, ''Tale of {{w|Lục Vân Tiên}}''
#*: {{ux|vi|公浪昆篤𠖈詩</br>'''牢'''空結伴麻𠫾𠓨塲|tr=Công rằng: "Con dốc xuống thi,</br>'''Sao''' không kết bạn mà đi vào trường?"|Công said: "You are here to take the examination,</br>So '''why''' don't you find some companion to go along with?"}}
# [[how]]
#: {{syn|vi|răng|làm sao}}
#: {{ux|vi|'''Sao''' tao biết được?|'''How''' should I know?}}
#: {{ux|vi|'''Sao''' làm được hay vậy?|'''How''' did you do that?}}
#* {{quote-book|vi|year=14th century|author=lw:en:Mạc Đĩnh Chi|title=Giáo tử phú 敎子賦|text=姉㛪庄𧡊<br/>𡥵丐能'''𣋀'''|tr=Chị em chẳng thấy,<br/>Con cái hay '''sao'''.|t=Not caring about one's siblings,</br>Nor knowing '''how''' one's children are.}}
#* {{RQ:Nguyen Trai Quoc am thi tap|chapter=述興 Thuật hứng 2
|passage=固身𪰛谷可𬈋'''牢'''
|translation='''How''' could I manage when I'm on my own?
|transliteration=Có thân thì {{l|vi|cóc}} khá làm '''sao'''.}}
# [[what]]; [[what is it]]; what [[now]]
#: {{syn|vi|làm sao|gì|cái gì}}
#: {{ux|vi|'''Sao'''?<br>'''Sao''' trăng gì !?|'''Wut?'''<br>The hell you mean, "'''wut'''"?}}
