===Etymology 1===
Attested quite late in Vietnamese literature. Likely a loan from some variety of {{cog|zh|爸}} (if so distantly related to {{m|vi|bố}}). The resemblance to {{ncog|fr|papa}} is probably coincidental.

In ''Đại Nam quấc âm tự vị'' (1895), the imitative ''ba ba'' was annotated as ''[t]iếng con nít hay kêu'' ("a word that children often use"), while glossed as {{m|vi|cha}}, the chief and/or formal word for "father".

