#* {{RQ:Vu Trong Phung So do|chapter = 1 | passage = – Một hào đấy! Bói rẻ còn hơn ngồi '''không'''. | translation = "Here you have a dime! A cheap fortune-teller is still better than sitting '''without anything to do'''." }}
# {{lb|vi|colloquial}} at a level that feels like nothing at all
#: {{uxi|vi|Việc dễ '''không''' mà cũng không làm được.|It was a piece of cake, but you just can't even get it done.}}

