con.raw:
===Etymology===
{{inh+|vi|mkh-vie-pro|*kɔːn}}, from {{inh|vi|aav-pro|*koan}}. Cognate with {{cog|mtq|-}} Bi {{m|mtq|con}}, {{cog|thm|กอน}}, {{cog|mnw|ကွေန်|tr=kon}}, {{cog|km|កូន}}, {{cog|bdq|kon}}, {{cog|kha|khun}}, {{cog|ncb|kōan}}. {{doublet|vi|non|t1=young, juvenile}}, which is from an infixed form of the root.

Attested in ''Phật thuyết đại báo phụ mẫu ân trọng kinh'' (佛說大報父母恩重經, {{circa2|12th cent.|short=1}}) as {{ltc-l|昆}} (modern [[Sino-Vietnamese|SV]]: {{m|vi|côn}}). Attested in the ''Annan Jishi'' (安南即事, 13th century) as {{ltc-l|乾|id=1}} (modern [[Sino-Vietnamese|SV]]: {{m|vi|can}}).

===Pronunciation===
