|text= Những '''chiếc''' mèo hài hước =))
|translation= [[funni|Funni]] cats =)) }}
** {{quote-web|vi|work= w:Thread|date=2025-04-01|author=nhanmoc|format= post
|url= https://www.threads.com/@nhanmoc/post/DH54uppBuV_
