# [[week]] {{gloss|any period of seven consecutive days}}
#: {{ux|vi|[[nghỉ hè]] tám '''tuần'''|to go on an eight-'''week''' summer holiday}}
# [[week]] {{gloss|period of seven days in the Gregorian calendar beginning with Sunday or Monday}}
# one of three ten-day periods in a [[month]] in the [[w:Vietnamese calendar|Vietnamese calendar]]; a [[week]]
# a [[decade]] of age
# a [[time period]]
# [[instance]], [[occurrence]]
