Originally a verb meaning "to move, to touch". This meaning can still be seen in the [[Appendix:Vietnamese reduplication#t- reduplication|''t-'' reduplicative]] {{m|vi|táy máy}} and the [[Appendix:Vietnamese reduplication#-âp reduplication|''-âp'' reduplicative]] {{m|vi|mấp máy}}, as well as some compounds like {{m|vi|mó máy}} and the aforementioned {{m|vi|máy mắt}}.

