===Etymology===
Most likely a loanword<!--- The syllables with the structure of final nasal + C tone (''hỏi'' or ''ngã'') are most often loans. --->.

Its source is unclear; compare {{cog|ltc|-}} {{ltc-l|侹|id=2}} "long, level, straight {{q|obsolete}}" → SV: {{m|vi||thính}}. See also {{m|vi|bằng}}.<!--- See also cẳng ---> 

The native Vietic word for "straight" is {{m|vi|ngay}}, which also has Khmuic cognates.

It is a {{semantic loan|vi|en|straight|nocap=1}}, in the sense of “heterosexual”.

