vào.raw:
===Alternative forms===
* {{alt|vi|vô|q=Central Vietnam, Southern Vietnam|pos=no diphthongization}}

===Etymology===
Attested as Northern {{cog|mkh-mvi|[[ꞗĕào]], [[ꞗĕaò]]}} in the ''Dictionarium Annamiticum Lusitanum et Latinum'' (1651). Compare the Central-Southern form {{m|vi|vô}}.

The Northern Old Vietnamese form is attested in ''Phật thuyết đại báo phụ mẫu ân trọng kinh'' (佛說大報父母恩重經) as {{l|vi|包}} ([[Sino-Vietnamese|SV]]: {{m|vi|bao}}), showing that diphthongization already took place in these dialects by then. The Central-Southern form {{m|vi|vô}} started showing up on texts much later, spelled chiefly as {{m|vi|無}} ([[Sino-Vietnamese|SV]]: {{m|vi|vô}}), inherited from unattested non-Northern Old Vietnamese dialects without diphthongization.

The usage of ''vào'' (especially in writing) by speakers of Central-Southern dialects can be attributed to borrowing from Northern dialects. On the other hand, the undiphthongized Southern form with palatal initial latter spread to the Northern and Central dialects as an interjection.

Most prepositions in Vietnamese were originally verbs: {{m|vi|cho||to give; for}}, {{m|vi|đến||to come; to}}, {{m|vi|tới||to arrive; to}}, {{m|vi|lên||to go up; onto}}, {{m|vi|ở||to stay; at, in}}, {{m|vi|theo||to follow; according to}}, {{m|vi|về||to return; about}}.

===Pronunciation===
{{vi-IPA}}
* {{audio|vi|LL-Q9199 (vie)-Penn Zero MSSJ-vào.wav|a=Hanoi}}

===Verb===
{{vi-verb|[[𠓨]], [[包]], [[󱚢]]}}

# {{lb|vi|transitive}} to [[enter]] {{gl|to go or come into a space that is on the inside, or is narrower than the current space}}
#: {{syn|vi|vô}}
#: {{ant|vi|ra}}
#: {{uxi|vi|'''vào''' nhà|to enter the/a house}}
#: {{uxi|vi|'''vào''' tù|to enter prison; to become a prisoner}}
#: {{ux|vi|Xe đi '''vào''' trung tâm thành phố.|The car goes into the city center.}}
#: {{uxi|vi|'''vào''' đất liền|to move inland}}
# {{lb|vi|transitive|by extension}} to go [[southwards]] in [[Vietnam]]
#: {{uxi|vi|vào nam, ra bắc|to go southwards and northwards}}
#: {{uxi|vi|từ Hà Nội '''vào''' Huế|to go from [[Hanoi]] down south to [[Hue]]}}
#: {{uxi|vi|vào [[Sài Gòn]]|to go to [[Ho Chi Minh City]]/[[Saigon]] from its north}}
# {{lb|vi|transitive}} to gain [[access]] to
#: {{syn|vi|truy cập}}
#: {{uxi|vi|vào trang cá nhân; vào mạng; vào sổ điểm|to go to a profile page; to connect to the Internet; to [[submit]] (a student's score) into a gradebook}}
# {{lb|vi|transitive}} to become a [[member]] of; to [[join]]
#: {{syn|vi|tham gia|gia nhập}}
#: {{uxi|vi|'''vào''' hội|to join the/an association}}
# {{lb|vi|transitive}} to [[carry out]] or to [[join in]], to [[participate]] in
#: {{uxi|vi|'''vào''' tiệc|to join/begin a party}}
#: {{uxi|vi|'''vào''' đám|to join/begin the ceremony}}
# {{lb|vi|transitive}} to [[begin]] (a new chapter in time)
#: {{syn|vi|bắt đầu}}
#: {{uxi|vi|'''vào''' năm học mới|to start a new school year}}
#: {{uxi|vi|'''vào''' hè|to begin one's summer}}
#: {{uxi|vi|trời '''vào''' thu|autumn sets in}}
# {{lb|vi|transitive}} to [[abide by]], to [[conform]] to
#: {{syn|vi|tuân theo}}
#: {{ant|vi|trái}}
#: {{uxi|vi|'''vào''' quy củ|to work according to a methodology}}
#: {{uxi|vi|'''vào''' khuôn phép|to abide by a code of conduct}}
#: {{ux|vi|Công việc đã '''vào''' nền nếp.|The task has become second nature.}}
# {{lb|vi|transitive}} to [[attain]], to [[achieve]]
#: {{ux|vi|Một người thợ '''vào''' loại giỏi.|A worker becomes skilled.}}
#: {{uxi|vi|học '''vào''' loại trung bình|to be average in one's studies}}
# {{lb|vi|intransitive|figuratively}} to [[comprehend]]
#: {{ux|vi|Có tập trung tư tưởng thì học [nó] mới '''vào'''.|Only by concentrating one's thoughts does one comprehend one's studies.}}
#: {{ux|vi|Đầu óc rối bời, đọc mãi mà [nó] không '''vào'''.|With his/her head in such a jumble, he/she keeps reading but [it] doesn't click.}}
# {{lb|vi|intransitive|soccer}} (of a ball) to [[enter]] the [[goal]]
#: {{ux|vi|Sút! '''Vào'''!|[[he shoots, he scores|He shoots! He scores!]] [Shoot! It's in!]}}

====Derived terms====
