===Particle===
{{vi-particle|[[𠓨]], [[包]], [[󱚢]]}}

# {{non-gloss|Used at the end of a clause or sentence to ask the listener to do something vigorously.}}
#: {{ux|vi|Làm nhanh '''vào'''!|Do it quickly!}}
#: {{ux|vi|Mặc thật ấm '''vào''' kẻo lạnh.|Dress truly warmly or you'll be cold.}}
