Attested as {{m|mkh-mvi|chuọt}} in the ''Dictionarium Annamiticum Lusitanum et Latinum'' (1651).

For the "biceps" sense, compare the parallels in {{ncog|la|mūsculus||[[muscle]]|lit=[[little]] [[mouse]]}} and {{ncog|grc|μῦς||mouse; muscle}}.

