===Etymology 1===
{{vi-etym-sino|花}}. The "capital" sense probably comes from the flourishes of the cursive capital letters that are commonly taught in elementary schools; even cursive lower-case letters don't have as many flourishes, which explains the distinction.

The form {{m|vi|ba}} is attested in some Central dialects, most notably from the placename {{m|vi|Đông Ba}}.<ref>Trần, Ngọc Bảo (2017). "Từ Điển Phương Ngữ Huế".</ref> It is also attested in chữ Nôm as {{m|vi|芭}} and {{m|vi|葩}}.

