của.raw:
===Etymology===
For similar grammaticalisations, compare {{ncog|th|ของ}}, {{ncog|km|របស់}}.

The usage of this word as possessive marker is recent, as even texts as late as early 19th century show ''của'' being used exclusively as a noun meaning "belongings, property".

There is no clear evidence if this is a non-Sino-Vietnamese reading of {{ltc-l|具||tool}} ([[Sino-Vietnamese|SV]]: {{m|vi|cụ}}) or {{ltc-l|貨||goods}} ([[Sino-Vietnamese|SV]]: {{m|vi|hoá}}), neither of which is straightforwardly connectable to the Vietnamese word.

