===Etymology===
{{vi-etym-sino|外|external, foreign|ngoại|hv=n}}. {{doublet|vi|ngoại}}.

===Pronunciation===
{{vi-IPA}}
* {{audio|vi|LL-Q9199 (vie)-Penn Zero MSSJ-ngoài.wav|a=Hanoi}}

===Preposition===
{{head|vi|preposition}}

# [[outside]] (of an [[interior]] or [[enclosed]] [[space]])
#: {{uxi|vi|'''ngoài''' nhà/phòng|outside the house/room}}
#: {{uxi|vi|'''ngoài''' vòng tròn|outside the circle}}
# [[out]] (through an [[opening]])
#: {{uxi|vi|'''ngoài''' cửa (sổ)|out the door/window}}
# [[in]]/[[at]] (an [[outdoor]] or [[external]] [[location]])
#: {{uxi|vi|'''ngoài''' sân|outside in the yard}}
#: {{uxi|vi|'''ngoài''' bãi biển|at the beach}}
#: {{uxi|vi|bệnh '''ngoài''' da|external (medical) conditions, as opposed to internal conditions|lit=illnesses on the outside, on the skin}}
# [[in]] (a [[place]] in [[northern]] [[Vietnam]])
#: {{uxi|vi|'''ngoài''' bắc|someplace in northern Vietnam; "the north"}}
#: {{uxi|vi|'''ngoài''' Hà Nội|in Hanoi, which is to the north of where we are}}
# outside (of); [[except]] (for); [[other]] than
#: {{ux|vi|'''Ngoài''' tôi '''ra''' thì không ai biết làm cả.|I'm the only one who can do it.|lit=Other than me, nobody knows how to do it.}}

===Adjective===
{{vi-adj}}

# [[outside]]; [[external]]
#: {{uxi|vi|bên '''ngoài'''|the outside}}
#: {{uxi|vi|người '''ngoài'''|an outsider}}

===Adverb===
{{vi-adv}}

# [[out]]; [[outside]]
#: {{uxi|vi|ăn '''ngoài'''|to eat '''out'''}}

====Usage notes====
The word can carry the meaning of "outside the space that the subject is/was in", so be aware of subtle nuances in meaning when using the word. For example, 
* '''Họ đi ra ngoài quán rồi.'''
can mean either "They went to the restaurant." (if, for example, ''they'' were at home) or "They went outside the restaurant." (if, for example, ''they'' were inside the restaurant). 
To explicitly specify that one is completely outside (and not inside) the specified area, use the compound word {{m|vi|bên ngoài}}.

