===Etymology 3===
{{rfe|vi|Semantic extension of the "good, well" sense of Etymology 2? For a semantic parallel, note {{ncog|ja|良く|tr=yoku|t=often}}, from {{m|ja|良い|tr=yoi|t=good}}.}}

====Adverb====
