===Alternative forms===
* {{vi-l|thời}}

===Pronunciation===
{{vi-IPA}}

===Etymology 1===
{{vi-etym-sino|時|time}}. {{doublet|vi|thời|giờ}}.

====Noun====
{{vi-noun|[[時]], [[辰]]}}

# {{alternative form of|vi|thời||[[time]]; [[period]]}}
#: {{uxi|vi|dăm '''thì''' mười hoạ|seldom}}
# the [[prime]] [[time]] in terms of [[physical]] [[development]]
#: {{ux|vi|đến thì/[[dậy thì]]|to hit puberty}}
# {{lb|vi|grammar}} a [[tense]]
#: {{uxi|vi|'''thì''' quá khứ|past '''tense'''}}

=====See also=====
{{col|vi|đến thì|lỡ thì|thì giờ|dậy thì|sinh thì|thì tiết|tức thì}}

===Etymology 2===
Most likely from etymology 1.

====Particle====
{{vi-particle|[[𬀦]], [[时]], [[𠱾]], [[時]], [[𪰛]], [[𲤘]], [[㫭]], [[辰]]}}

# {{lb|vi|after noun or pronoun or nominalized utterances}} as for ..., it is/does/will ...
#: {{ux|vi|[[tham thì thâm|tham '''thì''' thâm]]|lit=As for [the fact that one is] greedy, [it will lead to their] bruises|Greed will lead to one's downfall|inline=1}}
#: {{ux|vi|Hỏi nó thử xem. Tao '''thì''' sao cũng được.|lit=Try asking him. As for me, anything is good.|Try asking him about it. I'm all for it.}}
#: {{ux|vi|Có chí '''thì''' nên.|So long as you have your will, you will achieve greatness.|lit=As for [the fact that one] has willpower, [they will turn out] great.}}
#: {{ux|vi|Thôi đi cha nội! Mày '''thì''' biết cái gì!|Just shaddap! The hell do ya know?|lit=Stop it, paternal father! As for you, [you] know what?}}
#: {{ux|vi|Chồng '''thì''' gia trưởng, con '''thì''' hư đốn. Thôi tôi chết quách cho rồi!|My husband is a damn patriarch, my children are a spoiled bunch. Just grant me death already!|lit=As for [my] husband, [he is] patriarchal, as for [my] children, [they are] naughty. Forget it, I'll die!}}
#: {{ux|vi|Làm '''thì''' lười, thấy lòng lợn '''thì''' gắp lia lịa.|You always goof off, and yet when you see food you take more bites than you can swallow.|lit=As for when you work, you are lazy, as for when you see pig guts, you grab them non-stop.}}
# {{lb|vi|informal}} in that case, then ...; well, then ...
#: {{ux|vi|Nếu ổng hỏi thì làm sao?<br>'''Thì''' cứ vờ như không biết chứ sao!|What if he asks?<br>Just pretend you didn't know then!|lit=If he asks, what [should I do]?<br>In that case, just pretend you didn't know!}}
#: {{ux|vi|Ổng mà hỏi là chết tao!<br>'''Thì''' mày cứ vờ như không biết!|Man, if he asks me, I'm so dead!<br>Just pretend you didn't know then!|lit=He asks, [that will] doom me!<br>In that case, just pretend you didn't know!}}

=====Usage notes=====
* Used quite similarly to the Japanese topic particle {{m|ja|は|tr=wa}} to mark the topic of a sentence. However, unlike the Japanese counterpart, it doesn't need to accompany words for time or place to specify contrast; in those cases, such words may be simply treated as adverbials like their English equivalents. For example:
*:{{ux|vi|Hôm nay (thì) để tao đãi.|Today, I'll treat.|lit=As for today (as opposed to other days), let me treat.}}
* Can accompany {{m|vi|nếu||if}} and be translated as "then". In that case, the whole preceding "nếu-clause" functions like a noun.
*: {{ux|vi|Nếu mày biết lỗi thì được.|lit=As for the fact that you're sorry, it's okay then.|If you're sorry, then it'll be fine.}}

=====See also=====
{{col|vi|vậy thì|thì ra|thế thì|thì có|thì phải|thì chớ}}

