#: {{ant|vi|nhỏ|bé}}

====Usage notes====
* In many situations, this word and {{m|vi|to}} are interchangeable:
*: {{uxi|vi|nhà '''to''' mà chẳng ai ở|a big house where no one lives in}}
*: {{uxi|vi|căn nhà '''lớn''' trên đỉnh đồi|a big house on top of the hill}}
* However, ''lớn'' is also specifically used for things or concepts that are intangible or not visually perceivable, although not necessarily abstract nouns:
*: {{uxi|vi|nguồn cảm hứng '''lớn'''|a big inspiration|q=never *nguồn cảm hứng to}}
*: {{uxi|vi|dấu hỏi '''lớn'''|a big question (figure of speech)}}
*: {{uxi|vi|dấu hỏi to|a big question mark (like one written on a sheet of paper)}}

