{{com|vi|nước|t1=[[liquid]]|{{back-form|vi|豆漿|pos=[[Sino-Vietnamese|SV]]: {{l|vi|đậu tương}}|t=[[soy milk]]|nocap=1}}}}. The back-formation is influenced by the word {{m|vi|tương}}. The Sinitic term means "soybean", not "soy milk", in Vietnamese usage.

Compare {{cog|km|ទឹកសៀង||hoisin sauce}}, whose elements are cognates to the Vietnamese term. 

