#: {{ux|vi|Tàu '''ăn''' hàng.|Cargo was loaded onto the ship.}}
# to [[endure]] (a punishment)
#: {{uxi|vi|'''ăn''' đòn|to be spanked}}
#: {{uxi|vi|'''ăn''' đạn|to be shot at}}
# to [[enjoy]], to [[benefit]] from, to [[earn]], to [[win]] (money, a [[salary]], [[roses]], a prize)
#: {{uxi|vi|'''ăn''' thừa tự|to accept an inheritance}}
#: {{uxi|vi|'''ăn''' lương|to earn a salary}}
#: {{uxi|vi|'''ăn''' hoa hồng|to enjoy roses}}
#: {{uxi|vi|'''ăn''' giải|to win a prize}}
# to [[capture]] (a [[piece]] in [[board game]]s such as [[chess]], [[xiangqi]], etc.)
# to [[empty]] into (a body of water)
#: {{ux|vi|Sông '''ăn''' ra biển.|The river empties into the sea.}}
# to be [[subordinated]] to; to belong to (an [[administrative]] area)
#: {{ux|vi|Ruộng này '''ăn''' về xã tôi.|These woods lie within my commune.}}
# to have an [[effect]], to [[work]]
#: {{ux|vi|Phanh này không '''ăn'''.|The brakes don't work.}}
# to be [[equivalent]] to, to be [[worth]] (a quantity denominated in a smaller unit)
#: {{ux|vi|Một cân ta '''ăn''' 600 gam.|One traditional ''cân'' is equivalent to 600 grams.}}
#: {{ux|vi|Hôm nay một đô la Mỹ '''ăn''' mười ba nghìn đồng Việt Nam.|Today, one U.S. dollar is worth 13,000 Vietnamese dong.}}

