#* {{quote-journal|vi|title=Trà bạch đậu khấu thơm ngon với những lợi ích 'vàng' cho sức khỏe|url=https://khoe360.tienphong.vn/gia-dinh-suc-khoe/tra-bach-dau-khau-thom-ngon-voi-nhung-loi-ich-vang-cho-suc-khoe-1232952.tpo|newspaper=Tiền Phong Online|date=17 Jan 2018
|passage=Bạch đậu khấu thường được sử dụng làm nguyên liệu nấu ăn hoặc làm '''món tráng miệng''' nhờ hương vị tuyệt vời.
|translation=Cardamom is often used as an ingredient in cooking (main meals) or '''desserts''' owing to its excellent flavour.}}

====Usage notes====
*Despite the dedicated Vietnamese Wikipedia article and bilingual dictionaries, ''tráng miệng'' is first and foremost about fruit, not dessert, given how dessert was introduced much later from the West. As a matter of fact, fruit is more accessible for its price than dessert, and is even given out free of charge at certain dining establishments.

