#* {{quote-book|vi|title=里巷歌謠<tr:Lý hạng ca dao><t:Folk ballads from the hamlets and alleys>|page=42b|url=https://lib.nomfoundation.org/collection/1/volume/26/page/42|passage='''艺'''𱜢𱺵'''艺'''𫽄𨐮<br>𡛔𱜢𱺵𡛔𫽄𫨩悭𫯳|tr='''Ớt''' nào là '''ớt''' chẳng cay?<br>Gái nào là gái chẳng hay ghen chồng?|t=Which '''tailed pepper (berry) / cubeb (berry)''' is not spicy?<br>Which wife is not often possessive of her husband?}}
