From {{inh|vi|mkh-vie-pro|*ŋɛː}}. Cognate with Toum ''ŋɛː¹''. Compare {{cog|cog|-}} [Kasong] ''tŋeː''.
<!-- Similarity to the cognate set consisting of Malay dengar, Tagalog dinig, etc. is most likely coincidental as both Vietic and Pearic should show trace of final liquid. I also can't find any reflex of this set among the Chamic languages in Vietnam, so the chance these forms are from a Chamic form that lost the coda is really quite slim. -->

The sense related to smell has been attested since ''Đại Nam quấc âm tự vị'' (1895), a dictionary chiefly based on the Southern dialects.

===Pronunciation===
{{vi-IPA}}
* {{audio|vi|LL-Q9199 (vie)-Penn Zero MSSJ-nghe.wav|a=Hanoi}}
* {{audio|vi|LL-Q9199 (vie)-Jessica Nguyen (Pamputt)-nghe.wav|a=Ho Chi Minh City}}

===Verb===
{{vi-verb|[[宜]], [[𦖑]], [[𠵌]]}}

# to [[hear]] {{gl|to perceive sounds through the ear}}
# to [[listen]] {{gl|to use one's sense of hearing in an intentional way}}
# to [[listen]] {{gl|to accept advice or obey instruction; to agree or assent}}
#: {{syn|vi|nghe lời}}
#: {{ux|vi|Nó chẳng bao giờ '''nghe''' tôi cả.|She never '''listens''' to me.}}
#: {{ux|vi|Mày hư quá! Chẳng '''nghe''' mẹ gì cả!|You're so naughty! You never '''listen''' to your mother!}}
# to [[sound]]
#: {{ux|vi|'''Nghe''' hay vãi!|'''Sounds''' super cool!}}
#* {{RQ:Vu Trong Phung So do | chapter = 3 | passage = Sau mấy tiếng còi un un dữ dội '''nghe''' như tiếng gầm của một thứ lợn rừng kỳ quái, chiếc xe chờ ba phút thì có một tên gia nhân chạy ra mở toang hai cánh cửa sắt, đón xe từ từ vào sân. | translation = After several fierce sounds of the horn '''sounding''' like the roaring of some kind of monstrous wild boar, the car waited three minutes for a servant to run outside, pull the iron gate wide open, and let the car slowly into the yard. }}
# {{lb|vi|colloquial|Central Vietnam|Southern Vietnam}} to [[smell]]
#: {{ux|vi|Quái, sao cứ '''nghe''' mùi thum thủm?|Weird, I think I'm '''smelling''' a fart.}}
#* {{quote-book|vi|nodate=y|author=lw:vi:Phạm Hổ|title=Sầu riêng|trans-title=Durian|passage=Nhà ai vừa chín quả đầu. / Đã '''nghe''' gió thổi vườn sau thơm lừng.|translation=Who has freshly ripe fruit? / '''Smelling''' the delicious aroma carried by the wind.}}
# to [[feel]] (inside the body or of feelings)
#* {{RQ:Nguyen Ngoc Tu CDBT|chapter=Nhớ sông|passage=Họ chắc cũng từng yêu từng vui từng đau, từng '''nghe''' phảng phất niềm thương nhớ đất.|translation=They too must have loved, rejoiced, suffered, faintly '''felt''' that longing for their land.}}

