===Etymology===
From {{inh|vi|mkh-vie-pro|*buːŋʔ}}, from {{inh|vi|aav-pro|*poŋ|*poŋ ~ *poːŋ|belly}} (Shorto 2006, #624). Cognate with Kri Phoong ''pŭŋ³⁵'', {{cog|nuo|pũng}}, {{m|nuo|pụng}}, {{cog|km|ពុង}}, {{cog|mnw|ဗုၚ်|tr=pɜ̀ŋ}}. See also {{cog|th|พุง}}, an Austroasiatic loan.

