===Pronunciation===
{{vi-IPA}}
* {{audio|vi|LL-Q9199 (vie)-Jessica Nguyen (Pamputt)-chân.wav|a=Ho Chi Minh City}}

===Etymology 1===
Attested as {{inh|vi|mkh-mvi|chên||leg}} in the ''Dictionarium Annamiticum Lusitanum et Latinum'' (1651), from {{inh|vi|mkh-vie-pro|*ɟiːŋ||leg, foot}}, from {{inh|vi|aav-pro|*ʄɨːŋ||leg, foot}}. 

Cognate with {{cog|mtq|chân}}, {{cog|pac|adyưng}}, {{cog|bdq|jơ̆ng}}, {{cog|km|ជើង}}, {{cog|mnw|ဇိုၚ်}}, {{cog|jah|jong}}, {{cog|jhi|can}}.

Final velar *-ŋ was palatalized to *-ɲ after front vowel; this new form with *-ɲ (reconstructed as Proto-Viet-Muong ''*ciɲ'' by Ferlus) then gave rise to the modern form with ‹n›. See also {{m|vi|lên}}, {{m|vi|đến}}, {{m|vi|cù lần}} for other instances of palatalization of ''*-ŋ'' after front vowels.

