xin lỗi.raw:
{{phrasebook|vi}}

===Etymology===
{{compound|vi|xin|t1=to beg|lỗi|t2=mistake}}.

The literal meaning of these two words is "''to [[beg]] for [[someone]]'s [[mistake]]''", which some people might consider strange. It's possibly a shortened form of the more [[outdate]]d [[literary]] form {{m|vi|xin}} {{m|vi|thứ lỗi}}/{{m|vi|xin}} {{m|vi|tha thứ|tha}} {{m|vi|lỗi}}.

