===Etymology 2===
From {{inh|vi|mkh-vie-pro|*kiːm}}. {{vi-etym-sino|針|needle|hv=n|châm}}. Cognate to {{cog|mtq|kim}}.

Attested as {{m|mkh-mvi|kim}} in the ''Dictionarium Annamiticum Lusitanum et Latinum'' (1651).

