cắt.raw:
===Pronunciation===
{{vi-IPA}}

===Etymology 1===
From {{inh|vi|mkh-vie-pro|*kac}}, from {{inh|vi|aav-pro|*kacʔ||to pluck; to harvest}}. Cognate with {{cog|mtq|-}} Bi {{m|mtq|cách}}, {{cog|pac|kéiq||to pick, to pluck}}, {{cog|ngt|-}} ''kɛc'', {{cog|km|កាច់||to break, to snap}}, {{cog|bdq|kĕch||to harvest}}, {{cog|pbv|khait||to pick}}, {{cog|kns|-}} ''kec''. {{doublet|vi|gặt|t1=to harvest}} through a [[prefixed]] form.

Unrelated to {{ncog|zh|-}} {{och-l|割|tr={{IPAfont|*Cə-kˤat}}}} ([[Sino-Vietnamese|SV]]: {{m|vi|cát}}), although the two are sometimes (incorrectly) considered connected.

The Austroasiatic root ''*kac'' originally referred to the action of "plucking" and "breaking", with "cutting" being secondary. Not to be confused with the similar-looking root {{m|mkh-pro|*kat|*kat ~ *kaat|to cut}}, which gave rise to {{ncog|km|កាត់}} and {{ncog|kfp|-}} ''geɖ''.

====Verb====
{{vi-verb|[[拮]], [[㓤]], [[割]], [[𢵷]]}}

# to [[sever]] using a [[sharp]] [[object]]; to [[cut]], [[snip]], [[slit]], [[trim]], [[clip]], [[shear]], etc.
#: {{uxi|vi|sao chép, '''cắt''' và dán|to copy, cut and paste}}
# {{lb|vi|mathematics}} to [[intersect]]
#: {{uxi|vi|đường thẳng d '''cắt''' đường thẳng f tại điểm B|line d intersects line f at point B}}

=====Derived terms=====
