Compare {{cog|sa|कर्पास}} and {{cog|och|-}} {{och-l|布|tr={{IPAfont|*pˤa-s}}}} (B-S), both of which are probably Austroasiatic loans. {{doublet|vi|bố}} (as in {{m|vi|vải bố}}).

