===Etymology===
Often theorized as being from {{ncog|och|-}} {{och-l|烈|tr={{IPAfont|*[r]at}}}} (B-S) (SV: {{m|vi|liệt}}). However, the form ''tɑt⁷'' recorded in the Vietic lect of Cao Lao Hạ<ref>Ferlus, Michel. "[https://halshs.archives-ouvertes.fr/halshs-00922735/document Particularités du dialecte vietnamien de Cao Lao Hạ (Quảng Bình, Vietnam)]".</ref> and {{m|vi|tát}} in the {{w|Lộc Hà district|Lộc Hà}} lect of {{w|Hà Tĩnh province|Hà Tĩnh}}<ref>Nguyễn Thị Lệ Hằng. "Ngữ âm tiếng Lộc Hà - Hà Tĩnh".</ref> point to an older form with the initial cluster *''C-s'' instead of *''r'', therefore rendering the theory aforementioned unlikely. Compare pairs such as North Central {{m|vi|tắn}} vs. written standard {{m|vi|rắn}}, North Central {{m|vi|tít}} vs. written standard {{m|vi|rết}}.

