===Etymology 1===
Attested in ''Phật thuyết đại báo phụ mẫu ân trọng kinh'' (佛說大報父母恩重經) as {{m|vi|𠅜}}, the simplified composition of {{ltc-l|麻}} + {{ltc-l|例}} (modern [[Sino-Vietnamese|SV]]: {{m|vi|ma}} {{m|vi|lệ}}), and {{ltc-l|例}} (modern [[Sino-Vietnamese|SV]]: {{m|vi|lệ}}).  Attested as {{m|mkh-mvi|mlời}} in the ''Dictionarium Annamiticum Lusitanum et Latinum'' (1651).

====Alternative forms====
* {{q|Northern Vietnam}} {{l|vi|nhời}}

====Noun====
{{vi-noun|[[𡗶]], [[𠳒]], [[唎]], [[𢈱]], [[𱔀]], [[痢]], [[例]], [[𠅜]], [[𱔂]], [[𫜗]]}}

