#: {{uxi|vi|'''Bến''' Nhà Rồng|{{w|Dragon Wharf|Dragon '''Wharf'''}}, lit. Dragon House '''Wharf'''}}
# {{lb|vi|literary}} the [[shore]] of a [[body of water]]
#* {{quote-text|vi|year=1938|author=w:Hàn Mặc Tử|chapter=Đây thôn Vĩ Dạ (Here is the Vĩ Dạ Hamlet)|title=Thơ điên (Mad Poems) / Đau thương (Agony)
|passage=Thuyền ai đậu '''bến''' sông trăng đó,<br>Có chở trăng về kịp tối nay?
|translation=Someone's boat is moored at the moon[lit] river's '''shore''' there,<br>Shall it take the moon[light] back timely tonight?}}
# {{lb|vi|by extension}} [[station]] {{gl|place where a vehicle may stop}}
#: {{uxi|vi|'''Bến''' xe Miền Đông|{{w|Mien Dong Coach Station|Mien Dong Coach '''Station'''}}}}

====Usage notes====
* On land, large {{m|vi|bến}}, such as Ho Chi Minh City's ''Mien Dong Coach Station'', are stations where coaches and coach-vans used for inter-province travel can also park. Smaller {{m|vi|bến}} are only specialized for numbered buses, carts and autorickshaws used for in-province travel or commute.
