chèo.raw:
===Pronunciation===
{{vi-IPA}}
* {{audio|vi|LL-Q9199 (vie)-Jessica Nguyen (Pamputt)-chèo.wav|a=Ho Chi Minh City}}

===Etymology 1===
From {{inh|vi|mkh-vie-pro|*tʃ-r-ɛːw}}, an {{m|mkh-vie-pro|*-r-|pos=instrumental derivative}} infixed form of {{inh|vi|mkh-vie-pro|*tʃɛːw}}, whence Modern {{cog|vi|xeo||to lift up with a crowbar; to propel (a boat) with a long pole}}. Related to {{cog|vi|neo||anchor}}, {{cog|km|ចែវ||to row; paddle}}, {{m|km|ច្រវា||oar; paddle}}, {{cog|lo|ແຊວ||to row}}. Compare {{cog|zh|櫂|tr=trạo}}.

====Noun====
