# [[oar]] or [[paddle]]
#: {{syn|vi|mái|mái chèo}}

====Verb====
{{vi-verb|𢴿}}

# to oar, to paddle

=====See also=====
{{col|vi|chèo chống|chèo kéo|mái chèo}}

===Etymology 2===
Unknown. Theories<ref>https://www.studocu.vn/vn/document/hoc-vien-hanh-chinh/quan-ly-cong/nghe-thuat-san-khau-cheo/65837348</ref> include:
* A deviation from {{l|vi|trào}} as in [[trào phúng]], since the content of the opera is to make fun of bad practices in the contemporary society.
* A deviation from {{l|vi|chầu}}, whose writing in [[chữ Nôm]] include a character for mouth ({{l|zh|口}}) and a character that reads "chầu". See [[hát chầu]].
* A deviation from {{l|vi|chèo}}.
* A deviation from {{l|vi|trò}}.
* From {{l|vi|chèo}} in {{l|vi|chèo}} {{l|vi|thuyền}} (etymology 1).
{{wp|vi:}}

====Noun====
